N        EQU   16
INPUT    EQU   1000
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  2-N         S1. Loop on j. j ← 2.
2H       LDA   INPUT+N,1   S2. Set up i, K, R.
         ENT2  N-1,1       i ← j − 1.
3H       CMPA  INPUT,2     S3. Compare K : Ki.
         JGE   5F          To S5 if K ≥ Ki.
4H       LDX   INPUT,2     S4. Move Ri, decrease i.
         STX   INPUT+1,2   Ri+1 ← Ri.
         DEC2  1           i ← i − 1.
         J2P   3B          To S3 if i > 0.
5H       STA   INPUT+1,2   S5. R into Ri+1.
         INC1  1
         J1NP  2B          2 ≤ j ≤ N.
         HLT
         END   START
